  ],
  "duration_s": 94.109002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你酒量挺好的呀，领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。小王，你这菜点的也太多了。领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒。我先敬您。小王啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。来，这杯杯这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧，领导饭在哪我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密，咋这么多饭你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。小黄最近表现不错，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬一杯。听这意思。领导烧高升了呀，我得提前敬领导，一杯鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根。心腹是没有刺的这偶是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊哈哈哈哈哈，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1350,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1530,
      "end_ms": 1950,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2110,
      "end_ms": 3210,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3290,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4810,
      "end_ms": 6350,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6350,
      "end_ms": 6910,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 7010,
      "end_ms": 8590,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10090,
      "end_ms": 10510,
      "text": "小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 10850,
      "end_ms": 12550,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 12750,
      "end_ms": 14330,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 14390,
      "end_ms": 17030,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾多这杯酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17030,
      "end_ms": 17690,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20150,
      "end_ms": 20790,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21430,
      "end_ms": 23190,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23790,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26010,
      "end_ms": 28170,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28170,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 29630,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "这杯杯这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32120,
      "end_ms": 33760,
      "text": "领导饭在哪我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33900,
      "end_ms": 35780,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 35780,
      "end_ms": 37200,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39640,
      "end_ms": 41200,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41440,
      "end_ms": 42340,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 42820,
      "end_ms": 43240,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 43240,
      "end_ms": 44765,
      "text": "才守得住秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47940,
      "end_ms": 49520,
      "text": "咋这么多饭你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 49880,
      "end_ms": 50300,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50300,
      "end_ms": 51020,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 53100,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 53180,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 54760,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57880,
      "end_ms": 59240,
      "text": "小黄最近表现不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 59580,
      "end_ms": 61545,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61750,
      "end_ms": 62795,
      "text": "我得提前敬一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63110,
      "end_ms": 63790,
      "text": "听这意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 63810,
      "end_ms": 64850,
      "text": "领导烧高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 64850,
      "end_ms": 65710,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 65710,
      "end_ms": 68850,
      "text": "一杯鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 69210,
      "end_ms": 70450,
      "text": "可惜就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70610,
      "end_ms": 70870,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 70870,
      "end_ms": 72290,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 72430,
      "end_ms": 73590,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 73890,
      "end_ms": 79645,
      "text": "心腹是没有刺的这偶是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 80040,
      "end_ms": 81425,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 81840,
      "end_ms": 83740,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 83740,
      "end_ms": 86395,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 88650,
      "end_ms": 89310,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 89470,
      "end_ms": 90990,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 90990,
      "end_ms": 91825,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21b2bbf5e4976bdb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 92080,
      "end_ms": 93855,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
